---
/**
 * The line that starts the story, alone on black between Wasif now and 2022.
 * Every fact in it is from his resume and the storyboard.
 */
---

<section class="prelude" id="prelude" aria-label="Prologue">
  <p class="prelude__line" data-lines>
    In August 2022, I left Dhaka for a small college in Ohio to study the stars and the code behind machines. <em>This is what happened next.</em>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .prelude {
    display: grid;
    align-content: center;
    min-height: 90svh;
    padding: 18svh var(--gutter);
  }

  .prelude__line {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 21ch;
    font: 400 clamp(2.1rem, 1.2rem + 3.6vw, 4.6rem)/1.06 var(--serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.012em;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .prelude__line em { color: var(--silver); }
</style>
